%p
  Everyone please welcome my daughter, Lenora Valentine Lilley! She was born today at 1:39 PM. She and her mother are both doing well.

- unless intro
  %p
    There is not much else to report at the moment. Needless to say, going forward my life will be a little more full. So, now I can blame the lack of updates to this site on little Leni! I have a few projects in the works that I might post about soon, but we'll have to see how well the paternity leave treats me before I can make any promises on that front.